  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5R6Vc7i.png\" alt=\"標題\"></p><p>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/NotToBlame/clear-weather\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/GitHub-0C0D0F?logo=github&amp;style=for-the-badge\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fNotToBlame\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Ko--Fi-0C0D0F?logo=kofi&amp;style=for-the-badge\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://twitch.tv/NotToBlame\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Twitch-0C0D0F?logo=twitch&amp;style=for-the-badge\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/2kprrpbDfK\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Support-0C0D0F?logo=discord&amp;style=for-the-badge\">\n  </a>\n</p><p>🌧️  <strong>Clear Weather</strong> 是一款極簡的材質包，能減弱 Minecraft 的雨雪粒子效果，帶來更乾淨、對位元率更友善的體驗。無論你在錄製內容，或只是厭倦了視覺雜亂，這個材質包都能在暴風雨中保持畫面清晰，同時不破壞氛圍感。</p><hr><h2>✨ 特色</h2><ul>\n<li>✅ <strong>減少雨雪粒子</strong> – 惡劣天氣下更清晰的視覺效果。</li>\n<li>✅ <strong>實況主友善</strong> – 有助於避免大量粒子效果造成的位元率問題。</li>\n<li>✅ <strong>輕量級</strong> – 不增加紋理解析度，因此不會影響效能。</li>\n<li>✅ <strong>高度相容</strong> – 可與其他材質包一同使用。</li>\n</ul><h2>🖼️ 預覽</h2><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ogdgDEj.gif\" width=\"400\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Z9slA5O.gif\" width=\"400\"><h2>💬 需要協助嗎？</h2><p><a href=\"https://github.com/NotToBlame/clear-weather/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code>Github</code></a> 或 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/2kprrpbDfK\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code>Discord 伺服器</code></a>！</p>",
